lenovo-gnome-theme
==================

Trademarks
  Lenovo and Think are trademarks of Lenovo. This project is unofficial and is
  not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by Lenovo. It contains colour
  values only; no Lenovo logos, fonts or wallpapers are bundled or installed.
  Screenshots in docs/screenshots show a Lenovo wallpaper for illustration.

Yaru
  gdm/gdm.sh builds the login screen theme on the user's machine from the
  installed Yaru GNOME Shell theme (https://github.com/ubuntu/yaru, GPL-3.0 /
  CC-BY-SA-4.0), appending gdm/lenovo-gdm.css. The resulting file is a
  derivative of Yaru and is covered by Yaru's licence. No Yaru files are
  distributed in this repository.

Plymouth
  plymouth/plymouth.sh copies the spinner images from the installed Plymouth
  "spinner" theme (GPL-2.0-or-later) into the generated theme directory at
  install time. No Plymouth files are distributed in this repository.

Fonts
  Gotham is a commercial typeface by Hoefler&Co and is not included. Montserrat
  (SIL Open Font License) is installed from the distribution's packages when
  requested.
